  unitName: Greater Thunder Golem
  unitId: 87402602
  unitNumber: 7010
  description: 'Amidst the ruins of Orebus, Golems frolic without a care in the world.
    Noel captured several specimens of Golems and his experimentation bore some fruit:
    by merging Golems of the same element together and infusing their cores with
    the alien energy of Distilled Ethers, a new type of Golem is born. These Greater
    Thunder Golems possess the ability to further strengthen the bonds and powers
    of Summoned units. However, the Evolution seems to have broken them, leaving
    them to mutter strange, incoherent quotes.'
  summonDesc: My friend.. A journey of a thousand miles must begin with a single
    step.
  fusionDesc: 
  evoDesc: My friend.. A journey of a thousand miles must begin with a single step.
